uncertain or the lesion is changing.\\n\\n**Important**\\nThis is a **preliminary signal, not a diagnosis**. If this spot is new, changing, bleeding, itchy, or has irregular borders/colors, please have a dermatologist review it.\",\"media\":\"http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69be3b4593ce5ab1f19b2cfb/7b4e0181-9477-440a-b57c-c0606a9c499d.jpg\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9033,"output":442,"cacheRead":30720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40195,"cost":{"input":0.022582500000000002,"output":0.0066300000000000005,"cacheRead":0.007679999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0368925}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777281189252,"responseId":"resp_0ef6f6249d4f7cda0169ef28a5ad80819186927dc54d39a1aa"}}
