{"type":"message","id":"7aeaec82","parentId":"a6baf985","timestamp":"2026-04-27T09:28:08.934Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What changed**\nI updated the `skin-cancer-pipeline` so the heatmap is now treated as required output, not optional.\n\n**Behavior now**\nThe script now:\n- fails loudly if the pipeline response does not include the heatmap image URL\n- returns `heatmap_image_url` at the top level\n- returns `chat_media` at the top level\n- tags it as `chat_media_type: \"heatmap\"`\n- includes `meaningful_response.image_analyzer.heatmap_image_url`\n\n**Skill instructions**\nI also updated `SKILL.md` so the calling agent is explicitly told to always attach the returned heatmap image in chat on successful runs, and to treat a missing heatmap as an incomplete/failed run.\n\n**Verification**\nI tested the updated script on the same image, and it returned the expected heatmap fields correctly.\n\n**Next step**\nIf you want, I can run the skin-cancer-pipeline again now and confirm the chat reply uses the new heatmap-return path end to end.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ef6f6249d4f7cda0169ef2c24ea808191af7daea13289b64b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":351,"output":213,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51252,"cost":{"input":0.0008775,"output":0.003195,"cacheRead":0.012672,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0167445}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777282078031,"responseId":"resp_0ef6f6249d4f7cda0169ef2c1e78948191a85a3e4e0842be8f"}}
